  "html": "\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>OllieTree Youth Leaders</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"791\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/Untitled-design-1-1-791x1024.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/Untitled-design-1-1-791x1024.png 791w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/Untitled-design-1-1-232x300.png 232w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/Untitled-design-1-1-768x994.png 768w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/Untitled-design-1-1-1187x1536.png 1187w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/Untitled-design-1-1.png 1545w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 791px) 100vw, 791px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><strong>Angela Li&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></h4>\n<h6><strong>VP, Operations&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></h6>\n<p><strong>Providence Day School, Class of 2027</strong></p>\n<p><span>Hello! I am the Vice President of Operations, and I help with the organization and coordination of the youth group volunteers and activities. I also participate as a teacher in the tutoring sessions and a volunteer for various other events hosted by OllieTree. I enjoy working with other people to bring quality service to those in our community. In my spare time, I like reading and listening to music.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"791\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/Untitled-design-4-791x1024.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/Untitled-design-4-791x1024.png 791w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/Untitled-design-4-232x300.png 232w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/Untitled-design-4-768x994.png 768w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/Untitled-design-4-1187x1536.png 1187w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/Untitled-design-4.png 1545w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 791px) 100vw, 791px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><strong>Clark Fan&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></h4><h6><b>VP, Technology</b></h6><p><strong>Charlotte Latin School, Class of 2027</strong></p><p><span>I am the Vice President of Education and Technology. I help run our tutoring program, bringing new ideas and curriculum. I absolutely love teaching and helping others, as it brings me so much joy to see children grow and succeed. In addition, I am responsible for the OllieTree website to improve its accessibility, enhance its appearance, and keep the community updated.</span></p><p>I love to exercise and play cello.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"791\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/2-791x1024.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/2-791x1024.png 791w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/2-232x300.png 232w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/2-768x994.png 768w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/2-1187x1536.png 1187w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/2.png 1545w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 791px) 100vw, 791px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><strong>Jonathan Yu&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></h4><h6><b>Co-VP, Communications</b></h6><p><strong>Lake Norman Charter High School, Class of 2028</strong></p><p>Hello! I am the Vice President of Communications at Ollie Tree. I help manage our outreach by creating posters and social media content to keep our community informed about upcoming events. I also enjoy tutoring students during OllieTree’s Sunday study sessions and volunteering at our health clinics. Outside of OllieTree, I enjoy fencing, biology, and volunteering at Novant Health.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"791\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/1-791x1024.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/1-791x1024.png 791w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/1-232x300.png 232w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/1-768x994.png 768w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/1-1187x1536.png 1187w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/08/1.png 1545w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 791px) 100vw, 791px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><strong>Dennis Lin&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></h4><h6><b>VP, Education</b></h6><p><strong>Ballantyne Ridge High School, Class of 2028</strong></p><p>Hi! I’m Dennis, and I am VP of Education! I’ve had such a great time teaching at Ollie Tree, and I am looking forward to continuing to aid students in their journeys. OllieTree is a wonderful opportunity for students and teachers alike to learn. I enjoy playing cello and traveling in my free time.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"791\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/5-791x1024.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/5-791x1024.png 791w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/5-232x300.png 232w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/5-768x994.png 768w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/5-1187x1536.png 1187w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/5.png 1545w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 791px) 100vw, 791px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><strong>Audrey Lee&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></h4><h6><b>VP, Communication</b></h6><p><strong>Marvin Ridge High School, Class of 2028</strong></p><p>Hello!! I am the Vice President of Communications at OllieTree. My responsibilities include creating informative flyers or posters for any OllieTree event for both advertising and promotion. Additionally, I actively participate in being a tutor and volunteer in any OllieTree programs. I immensely enjoy teaching others about core subjects, with the hope of their future growth.&nbsp;</p><p>I love to create origami and play golf during my spare time!</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"791\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/2-791x1024.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/2-791x1024.png 791w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/2-232x300.png 232w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/2-768x994.png 768w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/2-1187x1536.png 1187w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/08/2.png 1545w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 791px) 100vw, 791px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><strong>Ethan Liu&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></h4><h6><b>VP, Chess Program</b></h6><p><strong>Ardrey Kell High School, Class of 2028</strong></p><p>I am the Vice President of the Chess Program at the Ollie Tree Foundation. As a National Master, I’m passionate about sharing my knowledge and love for chess with kids of all levels. I provide coaching and lead free group lessons to help students grow their skills and confidence. I also help organize mini-chess tournaments to create fun and competitive opportunities for young players. Outside of chess, I enjoy running and am a member of the Ardrey Kell High School Varsity Cross Country and Varsity Track teams.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"791\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/09/OllieTree-Youth-Leader-Icons-791x1024.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/09/OllieTree-Youth-Leader-Icons-791x1024.png 791w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/09/OllieTree-Youth-Leader-Icons-232x300.png 232w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/09/OllieTree-Youth-Leader-Icons-768x994.png 768w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/09/OllieTree-Youth-Leader-Icons-1187x1536.png 1187w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/09/OllieTree-Youth-Leader-Icons.png 1545w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 791px) 100vw, 791px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><strong>Ray Sun&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></h4><h6><b>Co-VP, Communication</b></h6><p><strong>Ardrey Kell High School, Class of 2026</strong></p><p>I’m the Vice President of Communications. I provide logistical support at events. I have contributed to managing OllieTree’s online presence through video production and social media. I’ve also been invested in the Youth Group’s educational tutoring.</p><p>I am member of the school’s Speech and Debate team. I also play the piano for both competitive purposes and my own enjoyment.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Former Youth Ambassadors</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>(2023-2024)</h4>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row cols-3\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"791\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/06/Untitled-design-5.png\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"791\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/06/Untitled-design-7.png\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"791\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/06/Untitled-design-8.png\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row cols-3\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4><b>Henry Chen</b></h4><h6><b>VP, Education</b></h6><p><strong>North Carolina School of Science and Mathematics (Morganton) Class of 2026</stro